that then you as a miner own.

00:47:53.995 --> 00:47:55.810
Yeah, so the reason

00:47:55.810 --> 00:47:57.225
for this

00:47:57.225 --> 00:48:00.485
proof of work mechanism is actually very

00:48:00.485 --> 00:48:01.715
very simple to understand

00:48:01.715 --> 00:48:04.510
in that, effectively,

00:48:04.510 --> 00:48:09.145
it's a way to randomly choose a miner from the set of all miners in the system.

00:48:09.145 --> 00:48:11.520
Yeah. So, you know, everybody

00:48:11.520 --> 00:48:13.280
invests a certain amount of

00:48:13.280 --> 00:48:16.220
energy in trying to solve a particular puzzle.

00:48:16.220 --> 00:48:19.520
whoever solves the puzzle, he's gonna kind of,

00:48:19.520 --> 00:48:22.300
wins the lottery and gets to mint the next block,

